bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Achievements Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AchievementController
control AchievementService
entity ":AchievementProgressModel" as AchievementProgressModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open My Achievements
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/achievement/me
activate Router

Router -> AchievementController: 3. getAchievementsForStudent()
activate AchievementController

AchievementController -> AchievementService: 4. getAllWithProgress(userId)
activate AchievementService

AchievementService -> AchievementService: 5. Check user
activate AchievementService
space
deactivate AchievementService

opt Invalid user
  AchievementService --> AchievementController: 5.1. BadRequestException
  AchievementController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 5.3. HTTP error
  UI --> User: 5.4. Show error
end

AchievementService -> AchievementProgressModel: 6. find(userId)
activate AchievementProgressModel
AchievementProgressModel -> MongoDB: 7. query achievement progress
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> AchievementProgressModel: 8. return data
deactivate MongoDB
AchievementProgressModel --> AchievementService: 9. progress list
deactivate AchievementProgressModel

AchievementService --> AchievementController: 10. return achievements 
deactivate AchievementService

AchievementController --> Router: 11. HTTP response
deactivate AchievementController

Router --> UI: 12. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 13. Show achievements & progress
deactivate UI
deactivate User